**Goal:** Push v2 checkpoint refs (`refs/entire/checkpoints/v2/*`) to remotes with merge recovery that avoids duplicating checkpoint data across generations.

**Architecture:** New ref-aware push functions in `strategy/push_v2.go` mirror the v1 branch-based push but use explicit refspecs for custom refs. `generation.json` is moved to archive-time only (no writes to `/full/current`), making all tree merges conflict-free. Rotation conflict recovery merges local data into the latest remote archived generation instead of creating duplicates.

